==French==

===Etymology===
Literally "to have there an [[eel]] [[hidden]] [[beneath]] a [[rock]]."

===Verb===
{{fr-verb|head=[[y#French|y]] [[avoir#French|avoir]] [[anguille#French|anguille]] [[sous#French|sous]] [[roche#French|roche]]}}

# {{context|by extension|idiomatic|lang=fr}} To suspect that there is something being hidden from us; to [[smell a rat]].

====Alternative forms====
* [[il y a#French|Il y a]] [[anguille#French|anguille]] [[sous#French|sous]] [[roche#French|roche]] ("there is an eel hidden beneath a rock")

